	"nodes":[
		{"id":"group003deps","type":"group","x":-50,"y":465,"width":1250,"height":465,"color":"1","label":"依赖收集系统"},
		{"id":"group004flow","type":"group","x":1300,"y":0,"width":500,"height":930,"color":"3","label":"响应式流程"},
		{"id":"group006bestpractice","type":"group","x":850,"y":1000,"width":950,"height":400,"color":"5","label":"最佳实践"},
		{"id":"group005perf","type":"group","x":-50,"y":1000,"width":850,"height":400,"color":"2","label":"性能优化策略"},
		{"id":"group001proxy","type":"group","x":-50,"y":0,"width":600,"height":400,"color":"4","label":"核心 API 层"},
		{"id":"group002proxy","type":"group","x":650,"y":0,"width":550,"height":400,"color":"6","label":"Proxy 拦截层"},
		{"id":"vue3reactivity001","type":"text","text":"# Vue 3 响应式系统架构\n\n深入理解 Proxy、依赖收集与性能优化","x":400,"y":-200,"width":500,"height":120,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node001reactive","type":"text","text":"## reactive()\n\n- 使用 Proxy 创建\n- 深度响应式\n- 对象/数组专用\n- 惰性转换","x":0,"y":50,"width":250,"height":150,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node002ref","type":"text","text":"## ref()\n\n- getter/setter 包装\n- .value 访问\n- 基本类型专用\n- 自动解包","x":280,"y":50,"width":250,"height":150,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node003computed","type":"text","text":"## computed()\n\n- 惰性计算\n- 缓存结果\n- 脏标记机制\n- 依赖追踪","x":0,"y":220,"width":250,"height":150,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node004shallow","type":"text","text":"## 浅层 API\n\n- shallowReactive()\n- shallowRef()\n- readonly()\n- markRaw()","x":280,"y":220,"width":250,"height":150,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"node005proxyget","type":"text","text":"## Proxy.get\n\n```js\nget(target, key) {\n  track(target, key)\n  return Reflect.get(...)\n}\n```","x":680,"y":50,"width":240,"height":140,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"node006proxyset","type":"text","text":"## Proxy.set\n\n```js\nset(target, key, value) {\n  Reflect.set(...)\n  trigger(target, key)\n}\n```","x":940,"y":50,"width":240,"height":140,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"node007proxydelete","type":"text","text":"## deleteProperty\n\n```js\ndeleteProperty(target, key) {\n  Reflect.deleteProperty(...)\n  trigger(target, key)\n}\n```","x":680,"y":220,"width":240,"height":140,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"node008proxyhas","type":"text","text":"## has / ownKeys\n\n- in 操作符\n- Object.keys()\n- for...in\n- 完整拦截","x":940,"y":220,"width":240,"height":140,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"node015step1","type":"text","text":"### 1. 创建响应式对象\n\n`const state = reactive({ count: 0 })`","x":1330,"y":50,"width":440,"height":100,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"node016step2","type":"text","text":"### 2. 创建 effect\n\n`new ReactiveEffect(() => { ... })`","x":1330,"y":180,"width":440,"height":100,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"node017step3","type":"text","text":"### 3. 执行 effect\n\n`effect.run()` → 设置 activeEffect","x":1330,"y":310,"width":440,"height":100,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"node029article","type":"file","file":"前端/深入解析 Vue 3 响应式系统：Proxy、依赖收集与性能优化.md","x":400,"y":-450,"width":500,"height":200},
		{"id":"node018step4","type":"text","text":"### 4. 访问属性 (getter)\n\n`state.count` → `track(target, 'count')`\n收集依赖","x":1330,"y":440,"width":440,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"node019step5","type":"text","text":"### 5. 修改属性 (setter)\n\n`state.count++` → `trigger(target, 'count')`\n触发更新","x":1330,"y":590,"width":440,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"node020step6","type":"text","text":"### 6. 执行 effects\n\n遍历 deps → 执行所有相关 effects\n完成响应式更新","x":1330,"y":740,"width":440,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"node021shallow","type":"text","text":"## 浅层响应式\n\n- **shallowReactive**: 只根级响应\n- **shallowRef**: 只 .value 响应\n- 适用: 大型列表、外部状态\n- 性能提升: 避免深度转换","x":0,"y":1050,"width":380,"height":160,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"node022readonly","type":"text","text":"## 只读优化\n\n- **readonly**: 跳过 setter\n- **markRaw**: 标记非响应式\n- 适用: 全局状态、大数据\n- 性能提升: 减少拦截开销","x":400,"y":1050,"width":380,"height":160,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"node023computed","type":"text","text":"## computed 缓存\n\n- 脏标记机制\n- 惰性计算\n- 依赖不变时复用\n- 避免重复计算","x":0,"y":1230,"width":380,"height":150,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"node024debug","type":"text","text":"## 调试工具\n\n- onTrack: 依赖追踪\n- onTrigger: 更新触发\n- 性能分析\n- 依赖关系可视化","x":400,"y":1230,"width":380,"height":150,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"node025composable","type":"text","text":"## 组合式函数\n\n✅ 返回 ref (解构后保持响应式)\n❌ 返回 reactive (解构丢失)\n\n```js\nreturn { count, double }\n```","x":880,"y":1050,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node026torefs","type":"text","text":"## 避免响应式丢失\n\n- 使用 toRefs() 解构\n- 不解构直接使用\n- ref 替代 reactive\n- 注意异步操作","x":1330,"y":1050,"width":420,"height":160,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node027pitfalls","type":"text","text":"## 常见陷阱\n\n❌ setup 外创建响应式\n❌ 异步中重新赋值\n❌ computed 中修改数据","x":880,"y":1230,"width":420,"height":150,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"node028scenarios","type":"text","text":"## 场景选择\n\n- 基本类型 → ref\n- 对象 → reactive\n- 大列表 → shallowReactive\n- 全局状态 → readonly","x":1330,"y":1230,"width":420,"height":150,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"node009targetmap","type":"text","text":"## WeakMap<target, DepsMap>\n\n```ts\nconst targetMap = new WeakMap()\n```\n\n- 全局依赖存储\n- 允许 GC 回收\n- 避免内存泄漏","x":0,"y":530,"width":350,"height":180,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"node010depsmap","type":"text","text":"## Map<key, Dep>\n\n```ts\ntype DepsMap = Map<any, Dep>\n```\n\n- 对象的属性映射\n- key → 依赖集合\n- 精确追踪","x":380,"y":530,"width":350,"height":180,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"node011dep","type":"text","text":"## Set<ReactiveEffect>\n\n```ts\ntype Dep = Set<ReactiveEffect>\n```\n\n- 属性的 effect 集合\n- 去重自动处理\n- 双向记录","x":760,"y":530,"width":350,"height":180,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"node014effect","type":"text","text":"## ReactiveEffect\n\n- effect 执行器\n- 依赖清理\n- activeEffect 管理\n- 调度器机制","x":760,"y":740,"width":350,"height":160,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"node012track","type":"text","text":"## track(target, key)\n\n- 依赖收集入口\n- 在 getter 中调用\n- 记录 activeEffect\n- 建立依赖关系","x":0,"y":740,"width":350,"height":160,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"node013trigger","type":"text","text":"## trigger(target, key)\n\n- 触发更新入口\n- 在 setter 中调用\n- 执行所有 effects\n- 调度器支持","x":380,"y":740,"width":350,"height":160,"color":"2"}
	],
